	(text "BOARD ID (GPIO32 = ID0, GPIO33 = ID1), not read by firmware yet.\nFit exactly one resistor per line. Rev 1 = 00: R9, R11 fitted; R8, R10 DNP.\nPrototype (pins floating, internal pull-ups) reads 11."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.7 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "09e3ea61-a4d6-5a64-b15d-d1c8a449b4d6")
	)
	(text "LEDs: RUN (GPIO2, strapping pin - LED + R to GND is a safe load) and DOOR (GPIO16). ~4 mA each."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 236.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3db3da5a-552a-5c80-83cb-468f5771c9a3")
	)
	(text "DHT22 / AM2302 (GPIO22), on board. Place at the far end from U1/K1\non a slotted neck; vent the enclosure."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "674e2683-de70-5967-a0ee-d00e5a477f41")
	)
	(text "REED SWITCH (GPIO4): closed = low, open = high.\n10k pull-up + 1k/100nF filter (~1 ms) + ESD diode at J3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8c9d6609-6b3f-5e21-9e4d-45a0603d1497")
	)
	(text "ESP32 DevKitC V4 (WROOM-32U)\nplugs into 2x 1x19 sockets (U1 footprint)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 90.17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.75 1.75)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a9aee152-6c3d-5774-8cc8-da000cb8e71a")
	)
	(text "MOUNTING: 4x M3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.7 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c42b7999-a663-50f5-b6d0-4eaadbbdb175")
	)
	(text "NOTES\n1. Firmware unchanged: GPIO map = main/board.h. Reset/factory button = devkit Boot button (GPIO0).\n2. Power J1 from 5.1-5.2 V. External 5 V and USB together only if the devkit has a diode on USB VBUS.\n3. Devkit rows are 25.4 mm apart (DevKitC V4) - measure the real board before ordering PCBs.\n4. Relay output is for the opener's low-voltage push-button input. Not for mains.\n5. Bring-up checklist: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-16-carrier-pcb-schematic-design.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.7 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cdae21af-27fe-51f8-8c06-0173a1aa8f38")
	)
	(text "RELAY (GPIO5): R2 4k7 pull-down holds GPIO5 ~0.3 V during boot (internal ~45k pull-up),\nbelow Q1 Vbe -> relay cannot pull in while the ESP32 resets. D2 = flyback diode.\nJ2: wire COM + NO across the opener's wall button (NC spare)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 69.85 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d45b596c-8407-5a55-be45-bc2b419caafb")
	)
	(text "POWER: 5.1 V in -> PTC fuse -> Schottky (reverse-polarity + USB back-feed block) -> +5V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e9ff41a2-0aec-5873-9676-06a27ea0be33")
	)
